==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|chn|potlatch|t=to give; gift}}, from {{der|en|nuk|p̕ačiƛ|t=to give in ceremony}}. Compare {{m|en|potluck}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈpɒtˌlætʃ/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈpɑtˌlætʃ/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# A [[ceremony]] amongst certain indigenous peoples of the [[Pacific]] [[northwest]] in which [[gift]]s are [[bestow]]ed upon guests and personal property is destroyed in a show of wealth and generosity.
# A communal meal to which guests bring dishes to share; a [[potluck]].
#: {{syn|en|fuddle|potluck}}

